Main's `Vine.A.*`, `Vine.Align.*` and `Stage1.Represents.Rep*` declarations that only the marked chain uses (in
neither L5a's PORTSET nor another packet's port), copied by source (sha256 in COPIED-SHA256SUMS) onto L5a's
